<title>SINGAPORE: SMB United 1996 net profit up 18.1 pct.</title>
<headline>SMB United 1996 net profit up 18.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				9.41 vs  7.96</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)			0.10 vs  nil</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		     2.68 vs  2.41</p>
<p>    Turnover				 53.23 vs 44.40</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 0.98 vs  0.66</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    0.15 vs  0.35</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation	   1.17 vs  1.09</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 12.99 vs 11.15</p>
<p>    Tax					 3.53 vs  3.14</p>
<p>Note - SMB United Ltd is involved in manufacturing and trading.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
